## Note on upstream code

This repository ports and adapts source code from the official ALHVR
implementation (github.com/ziziyao/ALHVR, "Adaptive Learning of
High-Value Regions for Semi-Supervised Medical Image Segmentation" by
Tao Lei, Ziyao Yang, Xingwu Wang, Yi Wang, Xuan Wang, Feiman Sun, Asoke K.
Nandi). That upstream repository does not declare a license of its own
(no LICENSE file present as of this project's clone date), meaning it is
under default copyright with no explicit permission granted for reuse or
redistribution.

The CC BY-NC 4.0 license above applies to this repository's own original
work (the γ_c class-aware threshold extension, documentation, scripts,
and any code written for this project). The files under `src/` that are
direct ports of upstream ALHVR code (each names its upstream source in
its module docstring) remain
subject to whatever rights the original ALHVR authors hold, independent
of this license — this project does not claim to grant permissions the
upstream authors themselves have not granted. This project exists for
academic/course purposes; if you are the ALHVR authors and have concerns
about this usage, please open an issue.
